00:20:40,950 --> 00:20:42,200
试图解释
to try to understand

404
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:46,070
为什么人类会有这些不同的思维定式。
why people might develop such different mind-sets.

405
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:48,270
他们加入了这项研究，然后我们说，
They came into the study, and we said,

